<template><WorkspacePage title="服务监控" subtitle="服务器、运行时与磁盘状态"><template #actions><a-button :loading="loading" @click="getList"><ReloadOutlined />刷新</a-button></template><a-spin :spinning="loading"><a-row :gutter="16"><a-col :xs="24" :lg="12"><a-card title="CPU"><a-descriptions bordered :column="2"><a-descriptions-item label="核心数">{{server.cpu?.cpuNum}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="用户使用率">{{server.cpu?.used}}%</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="系统使用率">{{server.cpu?.sys}}%</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="当前空闲率">{{server.cpu?.free}}%</a-descriptions-item></a-descriptions></a-card></a-col><a-col :xs="24" :lg="12"><a-card title="内存"><a-table :columns="memoryColumns" :data-source="memoryRows" :pagination="false" row-key="name"><template #bodyCell="{column,text}"><template v-if="column.key==='usage'"><span :class="{'text-danger':Number(text)>80}">{{text}}%</span></template></template></a-table></a-card></a-col></a-row><a-card title="服务器与 Python" class="wide-card"><a-descriptions bordered :column="2"><a-descriptions-item label="服务器名称">{{server.sys?.computerName}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="操作系统">{{server.sys?.osName}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="服务器IP">{{server.sys?.computerIp}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="系统架构">{{server.sys?.osArch}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="Python名称">{{server.py?.name}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="Python版本">{{server.py?.version}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="启动时间">{{server.py?.startTime}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="运行时长">{{server.py?.runTime}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="安装路径" :span="2">{{server.py?.home}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="项目路径" :span="2">{{server.sys?.userDir}}</a-descriptions-item></a-descriptions></a-card><a-card title="磁盘状态" class="wide-card"><ResourceTable :columns="diskColumns" :rows="server.sysFiles||[]" :pagination="false" :row-key="diskRowKey"><template #bodyCell="{column,text}"><template v-if="column.key==='usage'"><span :class="{'text-danger':Number(text)>80}">{{text}}%</span></template></template></ResourceTable></a-card></a-spin></WorkspacePage></template>
<script setup>
import {ReloadOutlined} from '@ant-design/icons-vue';import WorkspacePage from '@/components/Antd/WorkspacePage.vue';import ResourceTable from '@/components/Antd/ResourceTable.vue';import {getServer} from '@/api/monitor/server'
const server=ref({}),loading=ref(false);const memoryColumns=[{title:'属性',dataIndex:'name',key:'name'},{title:'内存',dataIndex:'mem',key:'mem'},{title:'Python',dataIndex:'py',key:'py'}];const memoryRows=computed(()=>[{name:'总内存',mem:server.value.mem?.total,py:server.value.py?.total},{name:'已用内存',mem:server.value.mem?.used,py:server.value.py?.used},{name:'剩余内存',mem:server.value.mem?.free,py:server.value.py?.free},{name:'使用率',mem:`${server.value.mem?.usage??'-'}%`,py:`${server.value.py?.usage??'-'}%`}]);const diskColumns=[{title:'盘符路径',dataIndex:'dirName',key:'dirName'},{title:'文件系统',dataIndex:'sysTypeName',key:'sysTypeName'},{title:'盘符名称',dataIndex:'typeName',key:'typeName'},{title:'总大小',dataIndex:'total',key:'total'},{title:'可用大小',dataIndex:'free',key:'free'},{title:'已用大小',dataIndex:'used',key:'used'},{title:'已用百分比',dataIndex:'usage',key:'usage'}];const diskRowKey=row=>`${row.dirName||''}-${row.typeName||''}`;async function getList(){loading.value=true;try{server.value=(await getServer()).data||{}}finally{loading.value=false}};getList()
</script><style scoped>.wide-card{margin-top:16px}.text-danger{color:#cf1322}:deep(.ant-card){margin-bottom:16px}</style>
